{"stem":"help-menu","source":"generated/help-menu.md","title":"Forge — /help menu (as shown inside the bot)","text":"# Forge — /help menu (as shown inside the bot)\n\nThe bot's built-in `/help` menu. Each module is a page of\ncommands with a one-line description and examples.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n### Basics\n\n- `/start` — Begin or continue your journey\n- `/help` — Open this menu\n- `/mystats` — Name, coins, catches & PvP at a glance\n- `/myinv · /myinventory` — Balls, stones, TMs & key items\n- `/rename <name>` — Change your trainer name, e.g. /rename Ash\n- `/query <text>` — Report a bug or suggest a feature, e.g. /query hunt lag\n- `/clear` — Unstick a frozen battle or trade\n\n### Regions\n\n- `/travel` — Your regions & travel menu\n- `/evtrain` — Pick a stat to EV train, then /hunt\n\nNotes:\n\n- regions unlock at trainer level = your gen number\n\n## Catching & Battle\n\n### Encounters\n\n- `/hunt` — Wild encounter: fight it or throw a ball\n- `/open · /close` — Hunt panel in your DM\n- `/safari` — Safari Zone info\n- `/enter <zone>` — Join a Safari zone, e.g. /enter Primal Ocean\n- `/exit` — Leave the Safari Zone\n\n### Battle\n\n- `/battle` — Fight a trainer (reply to their message)\n- `/challenge` — Challenge menu\n- `/gym` — Gym league & leaders\n- `/gymbattle <leader>` — Fight a gym leader, e.g. /gymbattle Brock\n- `/analyze · /battleanalyze` — AI breakdown of your last battle\n- `/zmine` — Equip a Z-Crystal (buy them in /shop → Z-Crystals)\n\nNotes:\n\n- catching keeps the Pokémon · winning battles pays 10–20 coins\n\n## Collection & Data\n\n### Browse\n\n- `/mypokemons` — Paginated list of everything you caught\n- `/mypokemon · /collection` — Quick list of your collection\n- `/data <name>` — Species data & spawn info, e.g. /data gyarados\n- `/details <name>` — Extended details, e.g. /details Charmeleon\n- `/stats <name>` — Full stat card, e.g. /stats Charmeleon\n- `/pc` — Storage box\n- `/search` — Open collection search\n- `/filter` — Interactive filter menu\n- `/sort` — Sort options for your list\n- `/myshinies` — Every shiny you own\n- `/myfav` — Your favourites\n- `/myforms` — Regional & alternate forms\n- `/nicknames` — Pokémon you've nicknamed\n- `/myanc` — Your Ancients\n- `/lineage <name>` — Family tree of a bred Pokémon, e.g. /lineage eevee\n\n### Manage\n\n- `/nickname` — Nickname wizard (pick, then type)\n- `/cancel` — Exit a wizard or dialog\n- `/display` — Choose what list rows show\n- `/setfav <name>` — Toggle favourite, e.g. /setfav pikachu\n- `/release <name>` — Release a Pokémon, e.g. /release charmander\n- `/forms <name>` — View & change forms, e.g. /forms pikachu\n\n## Team Building\n\n### Your Team\n\n- `/myteam` — Team card image & roster\n- `/teams` — List all your teams\n- `/newteam <name>` — Create a team, e.g. /newteam rain\n- `/delteam <name>` — Delete a team, e.g. /delteam rain\n- `/team · /setteam · /remteam` — Legacy redirects to /myteam\n\n### Train\n\n- `/move <move>` — Change a Pokémon's moves, e.g. /move flamethrower\n- `/bestnat <name>` — Best natures for a species, e.g. /bestnat garchomp\n- `/chart` — IV/EV calculator\n- `/evolve` — Confirm-screen evolution, e.g. /evolve bulbasaur\n- `/checkevolve <name>` — Evolution paths, e.g. /checkevolve charmander\n\n### Gear\n\n- `/equip <item>` — Hold an item, e.g. /equip leftovers\n- `/unequip <item>` — Remove a held item, e.g. /unequip leftovers\n\nNotes:\n\n- old /team · /setteam · /remteam redirect to the new system\n\n## Shop & Items\n\n### Rewards\n\n- `/daily` — Daily reward (main group only)\n- `/weekly` — Weekly reward (main group only)\n- `/rewards` — Streaks & reward status\n- `/redeem <code>` — Redeem a gift code, e.g. /redeem FORGE100\n\n### Market\n\n- `/shop` — Browse the market\n- `/pballs` — List every Poké Ball\n- `/buy <item> [qty]` — Buy items, e.g. /buy Ultra 2\n- `/sell <item> [qty]` — Sell items, e.g. /sell candy 3\n- `/use <item>` — Use an item, e.g. /use potion\n\n### Training\n\n- `/candy <name>` — Rare Candy +1 level, e.g. /candy pikachu\n- `/vitamin <name>` — Boost EVs, e.g. /vitamin pikachu\n- `/berry <name>` — Reduce EVs by 10, e.g. /berry pikachu\n- `/boost <name>` — +1 IV once per stat, e.g. /boost pikachu\n- `/nullcandy` — Reset a Pokémon to Lv.1\n\n### Gifting\n\n- `/give <coins>` — Give coins (reply to recipient), e.g. /give 100\n- `/send_tm <TM>` — Send a TM (reply), e.g. /send_tm 05\n\nNotes:\n\n- /daily · /weekly are main group only · /candy is groups only\n\n## Breeding\n\n### Eggs\n\n- `/daycare` — Drop off two Pokémon\n- `/breed <p1> <p2>` — Breed a pair, e.g. /breed pikachu ditto\n- `/eggs` — View your eggs\n- `/hatch` — Hatch a ready egg\n\n### Care\n\n- `/walk` — Walk eggs to hatch faster\n- `/warm` — Warm your eggs\n- `/care` — Care for your eggs\n- `/camp <name>` — Camp for 2 days to recover & bond, e.g. /camp eevee\n- `/leavecamp <name>` — Recall it early, e.g. /leavecamp eevee\n\n### Guide\n\n- `/breedhelp` — Full breeding guide\n\n## Social & Games\n\n### Trades\n\n- `/trade <you> for <them>` — Reply to a trainer, e.g. /trade pikachu for raichu\n- `/tradecancel · /canceltrade` — Cancel a pending trade\n- `/tradehistory` — Your past trades\n\n### Factions\n\n- `/faction` — Faction hub\n- `/factioncreate <name> | <desc>` — Create one, e.g. /factioncreate Rocket | Crime\n- `/factionjoin <name>` — Join, e.g. /factionjoin Rocket\n- `/factionleave` — Leave your faction\n- `/factionlist` — Browse factions\n- `/factionmembers` — Your faction roster\n- `/facinvite` — Share your faction's invite link\n- `/facedisband` — Disband your own faction\n- `/factiondonate <coins>` — Donate, e.g. /factiondonate 100\n- `/factionchest` — Faction chest\n- `/facwar` — Faction war hub\n- `/facwarreport <win|loss> [pts]` — Report a result, e.g. /facwarreport win 3\n\n### Games & Goals\n\n- `/guess` — Who's That Pokémon?\n- `/quest · /quests` — Daily quests\n- `/questclaim` — Claim quest rewards\n- `/achievements · /ach` — Achievement list\n- `/achclaim` — Claim achievement rewards\n- `/referral` — Referral link & rewards\n- `/motivation` — Random pep talk\n\n## Boards & Info\n\n### Leaderboards\n\n- `/leaderboard` — Top EXP · Pokémon · F.C (top 10 each)\n\n### Info\n\n- `/botstats` — Bot uptime & activity stats\n"}
